# Treasury PoC — Trivy allowlist
#
# Allowlist process: see docs/security/cve-policy.md ("Allowlist-Prozess").
# Every entry MUST be:
#   1. Approved by CEO via a comment on the corresponding ORA issue.
#   2. Annotated below with: CVE-ID, severity, ORA issue link, expiry date
#      (max 30 days, then re-review or remove).
#   3. Justified as a true false-positive or risk-accepted exception with a
#      compensating control (e.g. tomcat shipped but not network-exposed,
#      vendored binary not actually loaded at runtime).
#
# Format: one CVE-ID per line. Lines starting with `#` are comments.
#
# === Active entries ===
